@Demo.Sso.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5119

### 健康检查
GET {{Demo.Sso.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 查看白名单内的演示客户端（service）
GET {{Demo.Sso.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sso/clients
Accept: application/json

### SSO 登录（演示：任意非空用户名密码均可；复制返回的 ssoSessionId）
POST {{Demo.Sso.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sso/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "x"
}

### 用 SSO 会话签发一次性 ticket（把 <ssoSessionId> 替换为登录返回值；service 必须在白名单内）
GET {{Demo.Sso.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sso/ticket?service=https%3A%2F%2Fapp-a.demo.local%2Fcallback&ssoSessionId=<ssoSessionId>
Accept: application/json

### 校验 ticket（把 <ticket> 替换为签发返回值；一次性，重放返回"ticket 已被消费"）
POST {{Demo.Sso.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sso/validate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "ticket": "<ticket>",
  "service": "https://app-a.demo.local/callback"
}
